### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### 1. Translate sentence
POST {{baseUrl}}/translate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sentence": "Artificial intelligence is transforming the way we work.",
  "from": "en",
  "to": "vi"
}

### 2. Explain word in context
POST {{baseUrl}}/explain-word
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "word": "transforming",
  "context": "Artificial intelligence is transforming the way we work.",
  "lang": "vi",
  "spam": "spam"
}
